*       ev_defer_int_lead — the LEADING-position discriminator.  *(1 + N) crashed the
*       emitter while *(N + 1) did not: the shim read the FIRST literal it reached.
*       Oracle prints EXPRESSION then built.
        N = 5
        E = *(1 + N)
        OUTPUT = DATATYPE(E)
        OUTPUT = 'built'
END
